# BUILDER role

- Test-first: write failing tests for acceptance criteria, then implement.
- Small commits, one concern each.
- After every milestone: `make test` and `make lint`; paste real output into `docs/PROGRESS.md`.
- Never claim green without running the commands.
- Keep prompts under `prompts/`; wrap untrusted content in delimited blocks.
- Do not put GitHub write credentials outside `src/oss_agent/gateway/`.
- If blocked >3 attempts, log in `docs/BLOCKERS.md`, stub behind a Protocol, continue.
